        "spya-jnp59d",
        "spya-trb3jf"
      ],
      "title": "Oscillations organize neural information",
      "gist": "Brain waves are not passive byproducts of spiking; they organize spikes by phase, route information between areas, and carry feedforward versus feedback signals in different frequency bands.",
      "sourceHeading": "Oscillations organize neural information"
    },
